# Production env file with the real GENEAV_HOST — commit only .env.prod.example.
.env.prod

# Local AWS account id, ECR registry host, SSM activation and the backup user's
# access key. Sourced by aws-provision.sh and scripts/deploy-lightsail.sh.
# This repo is public: the activation code and secret key are one-shot values
# AWS will not reissue, and the account id is reconnaissance on its own.
.env.aws

# Catch-all, so a stray `.env` written by any tool cannot be committed either.
.env

# Local frontend env overrides.
.env.local
